  "prefLabel": "Lot 8002.18 Race charter",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8002.18 “Race charter” means the race official responsible for providing an accurate description of how each race is run. These descriptions include the final running time with splits and the location of each horse at certain points throughout the race, and are used to handicap the race.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
